@startuml 05h-abstractions
' 图 05H：@cantilune/evaluation 八层评估抽象。

skinparam backgroundColor #FCFAF7
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName "Microsoft YaHei"
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam roundcorner 12
skinparam ArrowColor #77716B

title 图 05H · @cantilune/evaluation 八层评估抽象
caption <color:#6E6963>evaluation = 离线可证伪评估系统（E0–E1 原型）。NEVER 修改 runtime world / control-plane policy。已落地 src/packages/evaluation/。</color>

top to bottom direction

legend top right
  |= 层 |= 抽象 |= 门面 API / 模块 |
  | E1 | 声明与协议 | EvaluationClaim · EvaluationProtocol | claims/ |
  | E2 | 基准套件 | BenchmarkSuite · BenchmarkCase | benchmarks/ datasets/ |
  | E3 | 候选/基线 | CandidateSubject · BaselineSubject | subjects/ |
  | E4 | 运行计划 | EvaluationRunPlan · BudgetPolicy | plans/ budget/ |
  | E5 | 执行引擎 | EvaluationEngine.admitRun/executeAttempt | execution/ |
  | E6 | 评分 / 评审 | MetricDefinition · JudgeProtocol · ClaimDecision | scoring/ oracles/ review/ |
  | E7 | 分析报告 | AggregateAnalysis · EvaluationReport | analysis/ reports/ |
  | E8 | 证据收集 | CertifiedTraceEvidence · TheoryOracleEvidence | collection/ oracles/ |
  | 横切 | 状态机·端口·适配器 | RunStateMachine · Ports · memory/file/cantilune | foundation/ ports/ adapters/ |
endlegend

rectangle "E1 · 声明与协议\nClaims & Protocol" #EDE8F0 {
  card "EvaluationClaim\nclaimCode evaluation.c1–c5" as E1a
  card "EvaluationProtocol\n可证伪设计 · 预注册" as E1b
}

rectangle "E2 · 基准套件\nBenchmark Suite" #E8EEF5 {
  card "BenchmarkSuite · BenchmarkCase" as E2a
  card "DatasetManifest\nprovenance · quarantine" as E2b
}

rectangle "E3 · 候选/基线\nSubjects" #F5F1EB {
  card "CandidateSubject\npackageConformanceCertificate" as E3a
  card "BaselineSubject\n外部产品 · adapter" as E3b
}

rectangle "E4 · 运行计划\nPlan & Budget" #F3E5DC {
  card "EvaluationRunPlan\npairedExecution · seed policy" as E4a
  card "EvaluationBudgetPolicy\nreserve-before / reconcile-after" as E4b
}

rectangle "E5 · 执行引擎\nExecution Engine\n<b>核心</b>" #E5EDE5 {
  card "admitRun → executeAttempt → completeRun" as E5a
  card "RunAttempt\ntoken/tool/network usage · cost" as E5b
}

rectangle "E6 · 评分与评审\nScoring & Review" #EDE8F0 {
  card "MetricDefinition · MetricObservation" as E6a
  card "ClaimDecision\nsupported / notSupported / inconclusive" as E6b
  card "ReviewerAttestation · 分离/dedup/COI" as E6c
}

rectangle "E7 · 分析报告\nAnalysis & Report" #E5ECEE {
  card "AggregateAnalysis\nstatistical · effect size" as E7a
  card "EvaluationReport\nsigned · limitations 明示" as E7b
}

rectangle "E8 · 证据收集\nEvidence Collection" #F7F3EC {
  card "CertifiedTraceEvidence\nDAG/Petri/π/Morphism 四投影" as E8a
  card "TheoryOracleEvidence\nLean symbol · premiseMissing" as E8b
}

E1a --> E2a : protocol 引用 suite
E2a --> E4a : plan 绑定 suite
E3a --> E4a
E3b --> E4a
E4a --> E5a
E4b --> E5a
E5a --> E5b
E5b --> E6a : 产出 observation
E6a --> E7a
E6b --> E7b
E7b ..> E1a : decision 反馈 claim
E8a ..> E6a : evidence → metric
E8b ..> E6a

note right of E5a
  NEVER 修改 runtime world
  NEVER 发行 conformance certificate
  budget: reserve-before, reconcile-after, fail-closed
end note

footer 类型 05A · 目录 05E · 状态机 05C · 理论 05F · RFC-0004

@enduml
